# SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
#
# NOT-8, the regression net for #230: while the log is up, nothing
# reaches the program. Six keys the adventuring screen would answer —
# search, cast, look, and three the party walks by — and the screen does
# not move.
#
# A **single** leg and not a pair, and that is not a shortcut. The
# seam-off run has no log to swallow those keys, so every one of them
# reaches the program: it searches, it casts, it walks. The two runs end
# in different game states and a diff between them means nothing
# (`docs/journal-test-plan.md` §3).
about nothing reaches the program while the log is up
kind single
program START.EXE
store tests/visual/reader-store.txt
both code-wheel
# The code-wheel bypass is gated on the wheel itself (#115), and both
# sides of this pair drive past the challenge, so both need it. Pinned
# by digest because a document never enters this tree.
document 0db301aeac4d2ec1e63b409ca6d3c9d39c63381d6712ff2ce7edc0528c6586fd
seam journal
until 300000000
every 25

key A@7601
key Return@7651
key L@8951
key A@9201
# The log, then the barrage.
key N@10600
key S@10900
key C@11100
key L@11300
key Left@11500
key Right@11700
key Up@11900
key E@12200

# From the log settling to the last of the barrage, one frame.
same 10900-12100
